@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/EvidenceSourceRecordRole> rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/EvidenceItem>,
        <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/SourceRecord> .

<https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/PartnerOrganizationRole> rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/Organization> .

<https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/SupportedAssertionRole> rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/Assertion> .

<https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/SourceRecord> rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
